{"id":102,"slug":"ma-jain-zh","resourceId":56,"nameNative":"马坚译（中文）","nameAr":"ما جيان","nameEn":"Chinese Translation (Ma Jian)","lang":"zh","source":"Quran.com API v4","sourceUrl":"https://quran.com","verses":[{"verseNumber":1,"verseKey":"102:1","text":"竞赛富庶, 已使你们疏忽,"},{"verseNumber":2,"verseKey":"102:2","text":"直到你们去游坟地。"},{"verseNumber":3,"verseKey":"102:3","text":"真的, 你们将来就知道了。"},{"verseNumber":4,"verseKey":"102:4","text":"真的, 你们将来就知道了。"},{"verseNumber":5,"verseKey":"102:5","text":"真的, 假若你们有真知灼见, (你们必不疏忽),"},{"verseNumber":6,"verseKey":"102:6","text":"你们必定看见火狱,"},{"verseNumber":7,"verseKey":"102:7","text":"然後, 你们必亲眼看见它。"},{"verseNumber":8,"verseKey":"102:8","text":"在那日, 你们必为恩泽而被审问。"}]}